#: rc.cpp:26
msgid ""
"AFMs (Adobe Font Metrics) are files that\n"
"may be used by programs (such as\n"
"StarOffice) to obtain detailed \"metrics\"\n"
"(e.g. sizes) of each character in a font -\n"
"so that it may be displayed/printed\n"
"correctly.\n"
"\n"
"AFMs may only contain one encoding,\n"
"so here you can specify which one\n"
"should be used."
msgstr ""
"Les fitchîs AFM (Adobe Font Metrics) sont des\n"
"fitchîs eployîs pa des programes k' i gn a (come\n"
"StarOffice) po-z aveur les «metrikes», dj' ô bén,\n"
"les grandeus, di tchaeke caractere del fonte,\n"
"po les pleur imprimer ou håyner comifåt.\n"
"\n"
"Les fitchîs AFM polèt n' aveur k' èn ecôdaedje\n"
"seulmint, adon vos poloz specifyî chal li kék eployî."

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid ""
"AFMs (Adobe Font Metrics) are files that may be used by programs (such as "
"StarOffice) to obtain detailed \"metrics\" (e.g. sizes) of each character in a "
"font - so that it may be displayed/printed correctly.\n"
"\n"
"AFMs may only contain one encoding, so here you can specify which one should be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Les fitchîs AFM (Adobe Font Metrics) sont des fitchîs eployîs pa des programes "
"k' i gn a (come StarOffice) po-z aveur les «metrikes», dj' ô bén, les grandeus, "
"di tchaeke caractere del fonte, po les pleur imprimer ou håyner comifåt.\n"
"\n"
"Les fitchîs AFM polèt n' aveur k' èn ecôdaedje seulmint, adon vos poloz "
"specifyî chal li kék eployî."

